const FAQ=()=>L()==='id'?[['Apakah tanaman aman dikirim ke luar pulau?','Aman. Tanaman dikirim dengan media tanam kering, dibungkus kertas dan bubble wrap, lalu dimasukkan ke box berlubang. Untuk luar Jawa kami sarankan JNE REG atau SiCepat BEST.'],['Bagaimana kalau tanaman rusak saat sampai?','Kirim video unboxing ke WhatsApp kami maksimal 1×24 jam setelah paket diterima. Kami ganti tanaman baru tanpa biaya.'],['Bisa pakai kartu ucapan custom?','Bisa. Centang "Kartu ucapan Just For You" dan isi nama penerima, pengirim dan pesan singkat. Kami tulis tangan sebelum dikirim.'],['Berapa lama pesanan diproses?','Pesanan sebelum jam 14.00 WIB dikirim di hari yang sama (Senin–Sabtu). GoSend same day tersedia untuk Jabodetabek.'],['Bisa pesan untuk souvenir dalam jumlah banyak?','Bisa, mulai 25 pcs. Gunakan kalkulator souvenir di atas lalu kirim permintaan penawaran via WhatsApp.']]:[['Can plants be shipped across islands?','Yes. Plants travel in dry potting mix, wrapped in paper and bubble wrap inside a ventilated box. Outside Java we recommend JNE REG or SiCepat BEST.'],['What if a plant arrives damaged?','Send an unboxing video to our WhatsApp within 24 hours of delivery and we will replace the plant for free.'],['Can I add a custom card?','Yes. Tick the "Just For You" card and fill in the recipient, sender and a short message. We write it by hand before shipping.'],['How fast are orders processed?','Orders before 2 pm WIB ship the same day (Mon–Sat). GoSend same-day delivery is available in Greater Jakarta.'],['Do you take bulk souvenir orders?','Yes, from 25 pieces. Use the souvenir calculator above, then send us a quote request on WhatsApp.']];
const CARE=()=>L()==='id'?[['Menyiram','Succulent lebih cepat mati karena kebanyakan air daripada kekeringan. Siram hanya saat media tanam benar-benar kering.',['Tusuk media dengan tusuk gigi. Jika keluar bersih dan kering, saatnya menyiram.','Siram sampai air keluar dari lubang pot, lalu buang sisa air di tatakan.','Jangan menyemprot daun roset; air yang menggenang di tengah bisa membuat busuk.']],['Cahaya','Kebanyakan succulent butuh 3–4 jam cahaya terang per hari. Tanda kurang cahaya: batang memanjang dan warna memudar.',['Taruh dekat jendela timur untuk matahari pagi yang lembut.','Putar pot seperempat putaran tiap minggu agar tumbuh simetris.','Haworthia dan terarium paling tahan cahaya tidak langsung.']],['Media tanam','Media harus porous supaya air cepat turun. Semua tanaman kami dikirim dengan campuran siap pakai.',['Campuran kami: sekam bakar, pasir malang, pumice dan sedikit kompos.','Hindari tanah kebun biasa yang padat dan menahan air.','Tambahkan pupuk slow release sedikit setiap 3 bulan.']],['Pot & ganti pot','Pot goni kami sudah dilapisi pot plastik berlubang di dalamnya, jadi aman disiram langsung.',['Ganti pot setiap 12–18 bulan atau saat akar keluar dari lubang.','Pilih pot 1–2 cm lebih besar, jangan terlalu jauh.','Diamkan 2–3 hari tanpa disiram setelah ganti pot agar akar pulih.']]]:[['Watering','Succulents die from too much water far more often than from drought. Only water when the mix is completely dry.',['Poke the mix with a toothpick. If it comes out clean and dry, it is time to water.','Water until it drains from the pot, then empty the saucer.','Do not mist rosettes; water sitting in the centre can cause rot.']],['Light','Most succulents want 3–4 hours of bright light a day. Signs of too little: stretched stems and faded colour.',['Place near an east-facing window for gentle morning sun.','Turn the pot a quarter turn each week so it grows evenly.','Haworthia and terrariums cope best with indirect light.']],['Soil mix','The mix must be porous so water drains fast. Every plant ships in our ready-to-use blend.',['Our blend: burnt rice husk, volcanic sand, pumice and a little compost.','Avoid regular garden soil, which is dense and holds water.','Add a pinch of slow-release fertiliser every 3 months.']],['Pots & repotting','Our burlap pots have a perforated plastic liner inside, so you can water them directly.',['Repot every 12–18 months or when roots poke out of the drainage hole.','Choose a pot only 1–2 cm larger.','Wait 2–3 days before watering after repotting so the roots can heal.']]];
